	(text "GPIO_VREF is tied to the CM5's own 3.3 V output (pins 84/86) for 3.3 V GPIO signalling, per datasheet §4.2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 276 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ce46bffd-9e73-4ddc-af05-9d7357ef286c")
	)
	(text "PMIC_Enable and PWR_Button are left floating (internal pull-ups). nRPIBOOT goes to jumper J6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 280.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "75074733-48b0-4184-a650-54381f3c36df")
	)
	(text "LED_nACT is an open-drain 20 mA output on the CM5: it sinks D2 directly. GPIO26 sinks D3 (software drives it low to light)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 285 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "09948ec9-6238-4800-8ed2-997430824290")
	)
	(text "microSD is powered from +3V3 directly; SD_PWR_ON (a power-switch control on the CM5IO board) is not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 289.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dbb050d8-a65f-467f-a533-269bffb31984")
	)
	(text "Magjack: UDE RB1-125B8G1A (the only 1000BASE-T magjack in the stock library). CM5 pair0..3 -> TD1..TD4; verify pair order and LED anode/cathode (L1..L4) against the UDE drawing. Centre tap left unconnected pending the CM5IO reference schematic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 294 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "63b71654-0941-4e50-8999-bf2401ccba74")
	)
	(text "USB-C is a device port (rpiboot / gadget): VBUS is not connected, CC pins have 5.1 k pull-downs so a host sees a UFP. USB_OTG_ID floats = device."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 298.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
